{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:23:10.516Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a7a7fc331bfeafd71</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/5e79b5c6-5688-4728-8d81-ff2c106a0e2e/tasks/a7a7fc331bfeafd71.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-13 (AC-04 regression test)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Commit succeeded: `d465ede`.\n\n## Summary\n\n**TASK-13** completed: \"Regression-proof: AC-04 (pnpm-workspace.yaml drives npm filtering when no workspaces field)\"\n\n- Confirmed all 8 prior commits (0971005..37fcada) present on `ignore_walk.rs` and tree was clean before starting.\n- Read AC-04's exact text from `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json` on disk (not the plan's paraphrase) — matched the plan's fixture (pnpm-workspace.yaml with `packages/*`, `packages/kept` matching, `tools/outside` not matching, no root workspaces field).\n- Added `ac04_pnpm_workspace_yaml_governs_npm_membership_when_no_workspaces_field` at `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs:367`, following the file's established `Path::new(...)` comparison style to avoid `clippy::cmp_owned`.\n- Ran the test first: it passed immediately (no red step), matching the plan's prediction that this is a genuine regression-proof already implemented by TASK-04b/TASK-06.\n- Adversarially verified non-vacuousness: temporarily forced `read_pnpm_packages` in `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs:273` to always return `None`, reran the test, confirmed it failed with a clear assertion message (`tools/outside` was wrongly discovered), then restored the original implementation.\n- Full suite: `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` → 284 passed, 0 failed. `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n- Committed only `ignore_walk.rs` (no implementation change needed) as `d465ede`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-13\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"verified 8 prior commits present and tree clean\",\n    \"read AC-04 exact criterion text from spec file on disk\",\n    \"wrote test ac04_pnpm_workspace_yaml_governs_npm_membership_when_no_workspaces_field\",\n    \"ran test: passed immediately (no red step, consistent with regression-proof pattern)\",\n    \"adversarial vacuity check: broke read_pnpm_packages to return None, confirmed test fails, restored\",\n    \"ran full cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib: 284 passed\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt -p callisto-graph and cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings: clean\",\n    \"committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"d465ede\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-04\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 367,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 255\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": \"No implementation change was needed since TASK-04b/TASK-06 already implemented the pnpm-workspace.yaml precedence path and wired it into IgnoreWalkLocator. Verified this honestly via an adversarial break-then-restore of read_pnpm_packages rather than assuming the plan's non-red claim was correct.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>83525</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>23</tool_uses><duration_ms>346742</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
