0`.\n5. Ran the test — it passed immediately with no implementation change (consistent with the TASK-07..13 \"regression-proof\" pattern; behavior already existed from TASK-06's wiring).\n6. Adversarially verified non-vacuousness: temporarily changed `NpmMembership::admits`'s `None =&gt; true` arm to `None =&gt; false` in `membership.rs`, reran the test, confirmed it failed exactly as expected (root admitted, child rejected), then restored the original code.\n7. Ran `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph`, `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean), and the full `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` suite (285 passed, 0 failed).\n8. Committed with message `test(graph): pin AC-06 no-npm-markers admits-all behavior`.\n\n**test_result**: pass\n**concerns**: None. No implementation change was needed — behavior already correct from TASK-06's membership wiring — consistent with the established regression-proof pattern for this stretch of the plan.\n\n**criteria_evidence**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"criterion_id\": \"AC-06\",\n    \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n    \"test_line\": 570,\n    \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n    \"implementation_line\": 230\n  }\n]\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>57694</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>19</tool_uses><duration_ms>323772</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
