ack 1a)","description":"Nothing populates VersionPlan.platform_writes/optional_dep_updates - needs planning logic built from scratch, not just consumption loops. Must integrate with Spec A/B write-batching safety invariants. canon-drafter to evaluate Spec-A/B-style split. BLOCKED until Decision 5 scope question is resolved and Track 1a ships.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 2","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"20","subject":"Track 4: Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness (Phase 2, full pipeline, gated on Decision 3, sequenced with Track 6)","description":"status --check exit-code contract inverted vs action.yml (release-PR path unreachable); clap exit-code 2 collides with no-changesets branch; callisto tag fabricates sha on mismatch; plan_publish never reads CHANGELOG.md back. Spans callisto-model, callisto-graph, and .github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml. BLOCKED on Decision 3 (JSON wire-format versioning).","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 4","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"21","subject":"Track 6-mechanical: JSON report-contract alignment (Phase 2, lighter TDD, gated on Decision 3)","description":"StatusReport/StatusPackageRecord/SnapshotReport/ComposePrBodyReport/CreatedTag/InitReport/ValidateReport field-shape mismatches. One report type at a time, never batched. BLOCKED on Decision 3 (JSON wire-format versioning), coordinate with Track 4.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 6 JSON report contracts","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"22","subject":"Track 6-doc: Fix atomic_write / \"no I/O\" stale spec claim (docs/01-spec.md §M.1.2, no pipeline needed)","description":"callisto-model documented as \"no I/O\" but atomic_write moved there deliberately. Real invariant is license permissiveness, not no-I/O. Doc-only fix, ready to do immediately.","activeForm":"Fixing atomic_write doc claim","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"23","subject":"Track 5: Changelog/PR-body rendering consolidation (Phase 3, full pipeline, depends on Track 1b)","description":"pr_body.rs bypasses render_section; ChangeSource::Commit and ChangeSource::NewGroupMember never constructed; ChangelogInput.entries doesn't union multiple causes. BLOCKED until Track 1b (pre_mutation_checks wiring) ships since NewGroupMember has no producer until then.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 5","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"24","subject":"Track 7: Performance - git revwalk bounding & redundant I/O (Phase 4, lighter TDD, parallelizable)","description":"commits_since_with_pathspec unbounded double revwalk (~2s vs ~13ms at scale, plus wrong changedSinceLastTag answer riding along); TagIndex::build per-package glob recompilation; workspace-root Cargo.toml re-read 3x; npm/cargo manifest re-read redundancy; inference pathspec targets manifest file not package dir. One finding at a time. Excludes the already-known deferred Cargo workspace-inherited dep rewrite batching gap.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 7 performance findings","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"25","subject":"Track 8-mechanical: ConfigError variants + Python workspace-root detection (Phase 4, lighter TDD)","description":"ConfigError::OverlappingPackageSets/PackageMatchedNothing never constructed; is_workspace_root has no Python-aware marker despite pyproject.toml being default-on.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 8 mechanical items","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"26","subject":"Track 8-doc: Fix Python \"demand-gated\" stale spec claim (no pipeline needed)","description":"Spec claims Python is demand-gated/not-implemented; real code is a complete 1681-line default-on implementation with 50+ tests. Fix the spec claim, not the code.","activeForm":"Fixing Python demand-gated doc claim","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"27","subject":"Track 11/12: Diagnostic/error-contract polish + remaining doc-only fixes (Phase 4, lighter TDD, queued serially)","description":"Missing #[diagnostic] attrs on ParseChangeset, inconsistent error-code coverage, stale spec Cargo.toml diagrams, wrong section citations. Low severity, batch-friendly but still one fix per commit.","activeForm":"Fixing diagnostic/doc polish items","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"28","subject":"DECISIONS: Resolve 5 open product/architecture decisions gating Tracks 2/3a/4/6/8-feature","description":"1) [[package]]/[[package-set]] match: name vs path semantics (blocks Track 3a). 2) moon.yml extensions.callisto: build or cut (blocks Track 8-feature). 3) JSON wire-format breaking change: schemaVersion bump strategy (blocks Track 4+6). 4) inference feature default-on status (cross-cutting). 5) Track 2 scope: single track or Spec-A/B-style split (blocks Track 2). Ask user before drafting specs for gated tracks. See /Users/gabe/.claude/plans/shimmying-giggling-hickey.md for full detail.","activeForm":"Awaiting decisions from user","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"29","subject":"Track 10 (Phase 5, deferred): Test/fixture infrastructure buildout - explicit scoping conversation needed","description":"callisto-fixtures missing GraphBuilder/ScenarioBuilder/ReplayCommandRunner/data corpus; several crates lack wasm32-wasip1 CI. Large, additive, no production-correctness impact. Matches SESSION_HANDOFF.md precedent: name it, don't schedule it. NOT started - needs its own future scoping conversation with user before any work begins.","activeForm":"Deferred - awaiting scoping conversation","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":14},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b946c384-abe6-4f51-bbba-891bdd152598","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:42:19.069Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.232","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
