{"parentUuid":"3d3365fd-fb61-44b7-a702-f509afc3c472","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8bMUQiEoEVAj6eaijf8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018CSrM5g6SJyKcKh11xzPC8","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Audit Track 1 spec quality","subagent_type":"canon:auditor","prompt":"Adversarially audit the spec@1 at /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118/scratchpad/spec-track1-draft.json (id SPEC-TRACK1-FIXED-GROUP-CASCADE-CORRECTNESS, for the callisto Rust monorepo at /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto — fixes three confirmed-live correctness bugs in the fixed-group version engine: cascade siblings bumped independently instead of to a shared group-aligned target, a pre_mutation_checks divergence/napi-drift check never wired into any command, and a ConflictingGroupMembership error variant never constructed).\n\nRead the full spec from disk (do not rely on any summary). Note: this spec was already through one round of canon-verifier, which flagged two issues that have already been corrected in the file you're reading — AC-006 (was self-contradictory, said \"plan_version does not call pre_mutation_checks\" when it meant plan_snapshot — now fixed to say plan_snapshot) and AC-009 (was overfitted to a specific implementation detail about local-variable binding — now relaxed to test behavioral outcome only). Verify these two corrections actually read cleanly and consistently with the rest of the spec as part of your audit, in addition to your standard five-dimension review.\n\nCheck the standard five dimensions: untestable/vague acceptance criteria, ambiguous phrasing admitting two valid interpretations, missing error cases for nil/malformed/out-of-range inputs, scope overlap with other workspace specs (check against .claude/specs/ in the workspace, particularly anything cascade/groups/version related — SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json, SPEC-TRACK3B1-IDENTITY-PROMOTION-CORE.json, track-b-idempotent-apply.json are all in that directory and touch adjacent-but-distinct areas, confirm no real overlap), and TBDs/incomplete sections.\n\nFor every issue found, produce a specific rewritten suggested_fix, not generic guidance. Output the standard JSON object with issues array and overall pass/fail verdict."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1170,"cache_read_input_tokens":361916,"output_tokens":881,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1170,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":881,"cache_read_input_tokens":361916,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1170,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1170},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8bMMHLgXtEVVWie7rT8","type":"assistant","uuid":"25a9aa1d-2d90-41c9-a671-e6fda8d603f3","timestamp":"2026-08-17T15:55:54.068Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
