\": \"8344b6b\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [],\n  \"concerns\": null\n}\n```\n\nNotes on scope discipline: while working, T03 (running concurrently) had already fixed `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs` in the working tree (uncommitted). I never touched `version.rs`. For `snapshot.rs`, since it's out of scope (T04, not yet started) but was blocking the whole `callisto-graph` lib from compiling — which meant `cascade_tests.rs`'s own errors were unreachable — I made a temporary, never-committed local stub in `snapshot.rs` purely to let the compiler reach the test crate for RED/GREEN verification, then restored the file to its exact original byte content (confirmed via `git diff --stat` showing zero diff on that file) before committing. Final commit `8344b6b` touches only `crates/callisto-graph/tests/cascade_tests.rs`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>63813</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>31</tool_uses><duration_ms>3022472</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
