{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-17T19:55:37.311Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a21e86b514c63303d</task-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/a21e86b514c63303d.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement T05 (Fixed-group convergence block)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Task T05 complete and committed (short SHA `1160367`).\n\nSummary:\n\n- Read T05 from the plan, and AC-001/AC-002/AC-004 text directly from `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK1-FIXED-GROUP-CASCADE-CORRECTNESS.json`.\n- Added the RED test `test_fixed_group_seeded_siblings_converge_on_shared_target` to `crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs` per the plan's exact spec, but with one necessary fixture fix: `bare_package` (empty `manifests`) breaks `Package::version_grammar()`, which `TagIndex::build` requires — so the test constructs packages with a canonical Cargo.toml manifest (mirroring the `make_pkg` helper pattern already used in `crates/callisto-graph/src/tags.rs`) instead of using `bare_package`. This is a test-fixture correction, not a spec contradiction — the plan's assertions and reasoning were correct; only the literal packaging helper needed a manifest.\n- Confirmed RED: first run failed on `Result::unwrap()` at the `TagIndex::build` call due to the fixture gap; after the fixture fix, it failed exactly as the plan predicted — `left: \"0.2.0\", right: \"2.1.0\"` on the `target_b` assertion.\n- Implemented the Fixed-group convergence block in `solve_cascade` (crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs:384-427), inserted immediately after the Linked-group block and before the outer `while changed` loop's closing brace, exactly as specified in the plan (mirrors Linked-group's severity max, calls `crate::groups::fixed_group_target`, updates `out.targets`/`out.severities`/`worklist`/`changed`).\n- Confirmed GREEN for the target test, then all 9 cascade module tests, then `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph`, `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean), and the full `cargo test -p callisto-graph` suite (all passed, 0 failed).\n- Committed as `1160367` — `fix(graph): add Fixed-group convergence block to solve_cascade`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"T05\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"Read AC-001/AC-002/AC-004 from spec file on disk\",\n    \"RED: added test_fixed_group_seeded_siblings_converge_on_shared_target, confirmed it fails before implementation (initially on a fixture manifest gap, then on the expected 0.2.0 vs 2.1.0 assertion after fixing the fixture)\",\n    \"Implement: added Fixed-group convergence block in solve_cascade per plan spec\",\n    \"GREEN: target test passes\",\n    \"Ran full cascade::tests:: module - 9 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo fmt -p callisto-graph\",\n    \"cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings (clean)\",\n    \"cargo test -p callisto-graph (full suite, 0 failed)\",\n    \"Committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"1160367\",\n  \"concerns\": \"The plan's exact test code used bare_package() (empty manifests) for pkg_a/pkg_b, which causes TagIndex::build to fail with ModelError::NoCanonicalManifest since Package::version_grammar() requires at least one canonical manifest. Fixed by attaching a canonical Cargo.toml ManifestDecl to each test package (mirroring the make_pkg helper already used in tags.rs's own test module) instead of bare_package. This is a fixture-only change; the test's assertions, scenario, and the implementation are unchanged from the plan.\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-001\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 1478,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 412\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-002\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 1465,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 388\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-004\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 1465,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 427\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reasoning\": \"Followed the plan verbatim except for a fixture fix required by real Package::version_grammar() semantics. RED confirmed twice (fixture bug, then true red on assertion). GREEN confirmed for target test, module, and full crate suite. fmt/clippy clean. Committed once.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>84859</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>51</tool_uses><duration_ms>655486</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
