ure with `Ok(...)` before the fix), implemented the `NapiTargetsIndex::load` + `pre_mutation_checks` call before `run_cascade`, merged `group_check.diagnostics` into the plan's diagnostics (GREEN — confirmed pass), ran `cargo fmt`, `cargo clippy -D warnings` (clean), and the full `cargo test -p callisto-graph` suite (all passing, no regressions). Committed as `ec801f3`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>67115</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>25</tool_uses><duration_ms>492986</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
