{"parentUuid":"0d71b7b3-b512-44ea-ac44-1e9f94c60f1e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2c2ed6ba-75bd-4860-952b-3eb829cb4be0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T2DkgLDnYGFwzjsP8meKb6","type":"tool_result","content":"\"Add a `callisto matrix` CLI subcommand that reads napi-rs and maturin native build target declarations plus npm/PyPI runtime-version constraints from workspace manifests, and emits a deterministic, structured MatrixReport (JSON or human-readable table) that CI workflows consume as the source of truth for build matrices, eliminating hand-maintained YAML drift.\"\n---GroupMember::PlatformManifest fields---\n28:    PlatformManifest {\n29-        owner: PackageId,\n30-        role: ManifestRole,\n31-        path: PathBuf,\n32-        name: String,\n33-    },\n34-}\n--\n46:            GroupMember::PlatformManifest { .. } => GroupMemberKind::PlatformManifest,\n47-        }","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"16351802-a69d-4c5a-b691-e0d1ab2fbe91","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:46:48.406Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"\"Add a `callisto matrix` CLI subcommand that reads napi-rs and maturin native build target declarations plus npm/PyPI runtime-version constraints from workspace manifests, and emits a deterministic, structured MatrixReport (JSON or human-readable table) that CI workflows consume as the source of truth for build matrices, eliminating hand-maintained YAML drift.\"\n---GroupMember::PlatformManifest fields---\n28:    PlatformManifest {\n29-        owner: PackageId,\n30-        role: ManifestRole,\n31-        path: PathBuf,\n32-        name: String,\n33-    },\n34-}\n--\n46:            GroupMember::PlatformManifest { .. } => GroupMemberKind::PlatformManifest,\n47-        }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0d71b7b3-b512-44ea-ac44-1e9f94c60f1e","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projec