{"parentUuid":"a31d5dc8-6852-413f-b764-62e5d46ea6eb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"65c9d1a3-553e-4bc8-9a6c-554bcaf9f996","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FcSwqkaWNNixpoCjKxZ1RK","type":"tool_result","content":"Make callisto-graph's plan_version() the real producer of VersionPlan.platform_writes and VersionPlan.optional_dep_updates for Fixed groups containing GroupMember::PlatformManifest entries, so a napi-rs/maturin platform package's own manifest gets bumped in lockstep with its owning package and the owner's optionalDependencies pointer to that platform package tracks the same target version. Also close two confirmed-dormant correctness gaps in apply_version_plan's existing consumption of these two VersionPlan fields (crates/callisto-graph/src/apply.rs), so that once plan_version starts emitting real data, that data is applied safely and its ecosystem's lockfile is refreshed/staged like any other bump.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c81325a3-a4cc-4913-845f-b2dfbe0f13da","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:09:00.453Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Make callisto-graph's plan_version() the real producer of VersionPlan.platform_writes and VersionPlan.optional_dep_updates for Fixed groups containing GroupMember::PlatformManifest entries, so a napi-rs/maturin platform package's own manifest gets bumped in lockstep with its owning package and the owner's optionalDependencies pointer to that platform package tracks the same target version. Also close two confirmed-dormant correctness gaps in apply_version_plan's existing consumption of these two VersionPlan fields (crates/callisto-graph/src/apply.rs), so that once plan_version starts emitting real data, that data is applied safely and its ecosystem's lockfile is refreshed/staged like any other bump.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a31d5dc8-6852-413f-b764-62e5d46ea6eb","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","use