{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:14:47.665Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a04f4bd3495288ccc</task-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/a04f4bd3495288ccc.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-5 (optional_dep_updates producer)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>## Summary\n\nTASK-5 (\"plan_version: optional_dep_updates producer (single platform member)\") is complete via TDD.\n\n**Steps completed:**\n1. Read AC-003/AC-004 exact text directly from `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK2-PLATFORM-MANIFEST-WRITES.json`.\n2. Confirmed baseline: `git log --oneline -3 -- crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs` showed TASK-2/TASK-4 landed, tree clean.\n3. Wrote two failing tests in `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs`:\n   - `plan_version_emits_optional_dep_update_when_owner_declares_matching_optional_dep` (AC-003) — RED confirmed: `assertion left == right failed: expected exactly one OptionalDepUpdate, got: []`.\n   - `plan_version_no_optional_dep_update_when_owner_has_no_matching_dependency` (AC-004) — confirmed passing trivially pre-implementation (expected, per plan, since the field was already hardcoded empty).\n4. Implemented the producer in `plan_version` per the plan's owner-resolution mechanism: resolves `owner` via `pkg_map`, calls `.canonical_manifests().next()` (first entry for dual-published owners), opens that manifest, checks `iter_dependencies()` for a `DepKind::Optional` entry matching the platform member's `name`, and only then accumulates an `OptionalDepUpdate` keyed by owner manifest path.\n5. `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph`, `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean), full `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` (373 passed, 0 failed, no regressions).\n6. Work is committed as `c3516baf` — `feat(graph): produce real OptionalDepUpdate entries in plan_version`. Verified the committed diff matches exactly what was implemented and tested.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-5\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"confirmed baseline (TASK-2/TASK-4 present, tree clean)\",\n    \"read AC-003/AC-004 from spec file on disk\",\n    \"wrote failing test for AC-003 and confirmed red\",\n    \"wrote test for AC-004 (passes trivially pre-implementation, as plan predicted)\",\n    \"implemented optional_dep_updates producer per plan's pkg_map/canonical_manifests()/first-entry steps\",\n    \"cargo fmt\",\n    \"cargo clippy -D warnings clean\",\n    \"full crate test suite green (373 passed)\",\n    \"committed as c3516baf\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"c3516baf\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-003\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 964,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 283\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-004\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 1046,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 331\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": \"Cargo owner manifests have no native optionalDependencies section, but Cargo does support `optional = true` on individual [dependencies] entries which iter_dependencies() maps to DepKind::Optional -- used a quoted TOML key matching the npm platform member's scoped name to construct a realistic AC-003 fixture. Confirmed both reds correctly: AC-003 failed with an empty-vec assertion before implementation; AC-004 passed trivially before implementation (expected per the plan's own expected_failure note) and remained green after. Noticed mid-task that other parallel agents had landed TASK-7/TASK-8 and an AC-002b spec correction on the branch; did not touch those, and confirmed via `git show` that the auto-checkpoint commit for this task (c3516baf) contains exactly and only the intended TASK-5 diff.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>129600</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>110</tool_uses><duration_ms>547825</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
