m platform writes), which is UNCHANGED and was already confirmed implementable with zero new code by TASK-2's already-landed producer loop (commit 431feb9, now further extended by TASK-5's optional_dep_updates logic at commit c3516ba — read the CURRENT state of crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs before writing the amended task, since TASK-2 and TASK-5 have both landed since this plan was first drafted).\n\nAmend ONLY TASK-3's test content to match the corrected AC-002b (replace the old \"real discovery\" test approach with the new fixture-construction approach — Workspace::load then push a PlatformManifest member with role: ManifestRole::Platform{..} into ws.config.groups.fixed, with the owner receiving a real bump). Leave TASK-3's AC-007 test content unchanged (still valid). Leave every other task (TASK-1, TASK-2, TASK-4, TASK-5, TASK-6, TASK-7, TASK-8 — all already landed/committed) completely untouched. Also verify TASK-6's test content (title \"plan_version optional_dep_updates: AC-007b merge behavior\") is still accurate against the ACTUALLY landed TASK-5 implementation (crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs, current state on disk) since it hasn't been implemented yet either — read the real current code, don't assume the original plan draft's description of TASK-5's implementation shape is still exactly accurate now that it's landed, and amend TASK-6 if needed too.\n\nReturn the amended task(s) only (not the full plan) — the calling process will merge them back into the plan file on disk."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":745933,"output_tokens":1368,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_availabl