iately with NO new implementation needed (TASK-2's loop is already generic enough to handle a fixture-constructed member and already hardcodes ManifestRole::Canonical). Verify this by actually running the tests, don't assume it's true just because the plan says so — if either test fails, the plan's own implementation.steps explain what bug to look for and fix.\n\nThis task modifies crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs only.\n\nStandard practices: `unsafe_code = \"forbid\"`. Run `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` before committing. Run the full crate test suite (`cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib`) to confirm no regressions. Commit once green, using the plan's commit_message. Report the exact short SHA from `git log --oneline -1`.\n\nReport back: task_id, status, steps_completed, test_result, commit_sha, criteria_evidence (file+line for AC-002b/AC-007), concerns."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":818,"cache_read_input_tokens":758146,"output_tokens":1104,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":818,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1104,"cache_read_input_tokens":758146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":818},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce96tznZeezfNXezSaRoc","type":"assistant","uuid":"78bb69d6-183c-49aa-b76d-2c80d1ad4b05","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:23:14.457Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-