ing (pushed directly into ws.config.groups.fixed after Workspace::load, matching AC-002b's/TASK-3's sanctioned technique) — do not assume both can be walk-discovered.\n\nStart by running `git log --oneline -8 -- crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs` and `git status` to confirm the tree is clean and TASK-5/TASK-3's commits are present before you begin. This task modifies crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs only. Verify the merge behavior by actually running the test — TASK-5's implementation should already handle this correctly with no new code, but confirm rather than assume.\n\nStandard practices: `unsafe_code = \"forbid\"`. Run `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` before committing. Run the full crate test suite (`cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib`) to confirm no regressions — this is the last task, so also run `cargo test -p callisto-graph` (full crate, all binaries) to confirm the whole crate is healthy. Commit once green. Report the exact short SHA from `git log --oneline -1`.\n\nReport back: task_id, status, steps_completed, test_result, commit_sha, criteria_evidence (file+line for AC-007b), concerns."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2547,"cache_read_input_tokens":760481,"output_tokens":1773,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":401},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2547,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1773,"cache_read_input_tokens":760481,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2547,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2547},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce97R3f3HEJhd7B4uWEJe","type":"assistant","uuid