{"parentUuid":"a1351169-5cad-457a-850d-5751d4995855","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce99dqA4Av7DH7hD4SjtC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both Track 1 and Track 2 are now fully complete — `just ci` green, all changes committed. Summary of where things stand:\n\n**This session's work:**\n- **Track 1** (fixed-group cascade correctness): 12 tasks, spec passed exit-gate on the 4th attempt after catching a genuinely wrong fix location, a borrow error, and a nonexistent enum variant. Mutation testing came back clean (zero survivors in new code).\n- **Track 2** (platform-manifest writes): 8 tasks, spec passed on the 3rd attempt. Mid-implementation, an implementer correctly caught that one criterion (AC-002b) was unsatisfiable as written — `walk.rs` only discovers npm platform manifests, never Cargo/maturin ones — so I routed it through a proper spec correction rather than faking the test, and the plan was re-amended for just that task.\n\n**Overall progress against the original 144-finding audit (12 tracks):** 5 of 12 done (3b–e, 6-doc, 8-doc, Track 1, Track 2). Two more (Track 3a, Track 4/6-mechanical) are blocked purely on decisions only you can make, not on effort — happy to walk through those whenever you want to unblock them."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_read_input_tokens":781828,"output_tokens":968,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":552},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":781828,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"di