{"parentUuid":"ff75fd54-9e9a-4673-ae08-32b5d580bc0a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce9ngKsZswDAyd8JmfVW5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2223,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1171},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2223,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011Ce9ngEKwbCLZngVoxxjKe","type":"assistant","uuid":"d41b82c0-ba86-4e0f-b054-eb343cff0c2a","timestamp":"2026-08-18T07:05:07.073Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"d41b82c0-ba86-4e0f-b054-eb343cff0c2a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce9ngKsZswDAyd8JmfVW5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both blockers are genuine product/architecture calls only you can make — I don't have visibility into real-world usage or external consumers to decide them safely. Here's what each needs:\n\n**Decision 1 (blocks Track 3a):** `[[package]]`/`[[package-set]] match` semantics. The docs and config examples define `match` against a package's workspace-relative *path* (`crates/*`, `packages/special-case`), but the real implementation matches against the package *name* instead. Fixing it to match the docs is a real behavioral change to how every `callisto.toml` pattern gets interpreted.\n\n**Decision 2 (blocks Track 4 and Track 6-mechanical):** JSON wire-format. `StatusReport`, `SnapshotReport`, `ComposePrBodyReport`, `CreatedTag`, `ValidateReport`, `InitReport` all have field-shape mismatches against the documented contract that the shipped GitHub Action's `jq` parsing depends on. Fixing them changes the wire format these types produce."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2223,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1171},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2223,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011Ce9ngEKwbCLZngVoxxjKe","type":"assistant","uuid":"3a3a1a5f-71a2-4fd0-a1a2-e0e9c8328f1a","timestamp":"2026-08-18T07:05:10.224Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"3a3a1a5f-71a2-4fd0-a1a2-e0e9c8328f1a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce9ngKsZswDAyd8JmfVW5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vux37GpNiF23vxg4ngMFid","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"Does any real callisto.toml config you know of rely on match patterns being interpreted as package NAMES rather than paths?","header":"Match semantics","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"No — ship path-based matching (Recommended)","description":"Matches the documented, intended behavior. Fix config/resolve.rs and config/pattern.rs to match against workspace-relative path instead of name."},{"label":"Yes, or I'm not sure — correct the docs instead","description":"Leave the name-based matching behavior as-is (it's load-bearing for real configs) and fix docs/00-design.md and docs/01-spec.md to describe what the code actually does, treating this as a doc-only correction like Track 6-doc/8-doc."},{"label":"I need to check first","description":"Don't decide yet — I'll hold Track 3a until you've had a chance to look at your real config(s)."}]},{"question":"How should the JSON report wire-format breaking changes be versioned for the shipped GitHub Action and any other consumers?","header":"Wire format","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Bump schemaVersion (major rev) (Recommended)","description":"Clean, explicit break. All six report types already carry schemaVersion — bump it, update the shipped Action's jq parsing to match in the same coordinated release (this is exactly what Track 4 already covers)."},{"label":"Additive-only changes with deprecation","description":"Safer for any external consumers pinned to an older Action version — add corrected fields alongside the existing (wrong) ones, deprecate the old ones over time. More surface area, slower to land."},{"label":"Just fix it, no formal versioning story","description":"Treat this purely as a correctness fix. Simplest, but risky if anyone outside this repo consumes the JSON output directly and isn't pinned to the Action version that gets updated in lockstep."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2223,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1171},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2223,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783983},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011Ce9ngEKwbCLZngVoxxjKe","type":"assistant","uuid":"c1efb1f3-63ed-41ce-ac72-efa96bed7edf","timestamp":"2026-08-18T07:05:16.720Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
