{"parentUuid":"72cc60ff-a5fb-4824-a868-fbfe97cc60fc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3f6d3ffe-8d7a-40a5-97d2-978434159727","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FHZFyUPS7bGK6e1gZWe9mN","type":"tool_result","content":"108\t### Track 3a/3b1: Workspace-Membership Filtering + Identity-Promotion Core — DONE\n109\t\n110\tSpec: `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json` (34 AC), `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3B1-IDENTITY-PROMOTION-CORE.json` (27 AC)\n111\tPlan: `.claude/plans/PLAN-TRACK3B1-IDENTITY-PROMOTION-CORE.json` (22 tasks, T01a–T17)\n112\tImplementation: `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/{membership,ignore_walk}.rs` (Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace membership filtering, 45 tasks), `crates/callisto-graph/src/{identity,walk}.rs` (ecosystem-prefixed identity resolution, disjoint cross-ecosystem promotion, `resolve_native_with_fallback` silent-fallback removal).\n113\tThis is the master remediation plan's \"Track 3b–e\" (identity/ecosystem resolution hardening) — all four originally-confirmed live bugs fixed: `IgnoreWalkLocator::projects()` now filters by Cargo/npm/pnpm membership globs; `IdentityIndex.prefixed` populated; `package_manifest_decls` disambiguates same-named cross-ecosystem packages via promotion instead of erroring; `resolve_native_with_fallback`'s silent cross-ecosystem match removed.\n114\tExit-gate: PASS. `just ci` green throughout.\n115\tNote: Track 3a (name-vs-path `[[package]]`/`[[package-set]] match` semantics — a *different* item, still gated on an unresolved open decision) is NOT part of this entry — do not conflate the two \"Track 3a\" labels from two different planning documents.\n116\t\n117\t### Track 6-doc / 8-doc: Stale Spec Claims (I/O boundary, Python ecosystem status) — DONE"}]},"uuid":"647c4c41-df7d-4273-b888-d79e87613218","timestamp":"2026-08-18T08:23:57.092Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/plans/ACTIVE.md","content":"### Track 3a/3b1: Workspace-Membership Filtering + Identity-Promotion Core — DONE\n\nSpec: `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json` (34 AC), `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3B1-IDENTITY-PROMOTION-CORE.json` (27 AC)\nPlan: `.claude/plans/PLAN-TRACK3B1-IDENTITY-PROMOTION-CORE.json` (22 tasks, T01a–T17)\nImplementation: `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/{membership,ignore_walk}.rs` (Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace membership filtering, 45 tasks), `crates/callisto-graph/src/{identity,walk}.rs` (ecosystem-prefixed identity resolution, disjoint cross-ecosystem promotion, `resolve_native_with_fallback` silent-fallback removal).\nThis is the master remediation plan's \"Track 3b–e\" (identity/ecosystem resolution hardening) — all four originally-confirmed live bugs fixed: `IgnoreWalkLocator::projects()` now filters by Cargo/npm/pnpm membership globs; `IdentityIndex.prefixed` populated; `package_manifest_decls` disambiguates same-named cross-ecosystem packages via promotion instead of erroring; `resolve_native_with_fallback`'s silent cross-ecosystem match removed.\nExit-gate: PASS. `just ci` green throughout.\nNote: Track 3a (name-vs-path `[[package]]`/`[[package-set]] match` semantics — a *different* item, still gated on an unresolved open decision) is NOT part of this entry — do not conflate the two \"Track 3a\" labels from two different planning documents.\n\n### Track 6-doc / 8-doc: Stale Spec Claims (I/O boundary, Python ecosystem status) — DONE","numLines":10,"startLine":108,"totalLines":170}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"72cc60ff-a5fb-4824-a868-fbfe97cc60fc","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
