oes not apply here since there is no implementation step in this task). As an optional double-check only, you may temporarily revert T3's fix (replace `name: input.identity.native_name(&edge.to, eco).map(str::to_string).unwrap_or_else(|| edge.to.name().to_string()),` back to `name: edge.to.name().to_string(),` in an uncommitted working-tree edit) and confirm both tests still pass identically -- both expressions are mathematically equivalent when no native_name registration exists, so this reversion check should show no difference. Then restore T3's fix before committing.\",\n        \"Add these two test functions to crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs's `#[cfg(test)] mod tests` block, immediately after `test_dual_identity_rewrite_key_uses_dependents_ecosystem_native_name` (added in T3):"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":876,"cache_read_input_tokens":108505,"output_tokens":1056,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":876,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1056,"cache_read_input_tokens":108505,"cache_creation_input_tokens":876,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":876},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeA3GK14DFN2qQMo3tVQg","type":"assistant","uuid":"e0fed798-9bc0-40d6-be81-b4da6b92194d","timestamp":"2026-08-18T10:16:09.980Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
